OL,3,AChancellor John Healey delivering his
OL,4,Afirst Budget - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is delivering
OL,7,Fhis first Budget, saying it is built on
OL,8,F"fiscal discipline" - watch live above
OL,10,FHealey says movements in financial
OL,11,Fmarkets - caused by concerns about debt
OL,12,Fand inflation, here and elsewhere -
OL,13,Fhave added an extra #14bn to the
OL,14,Fgovernment's borrowing costs
OL,16,FThe chancellor has already announced
OL,17,Fstanding charges are to be scrapped
OL,18,Ffrom household gas bills
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
