OL,3,AChancellor John Healey delivering his
OL,4,Afirst Budget - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move - due to take effect next year
OL,7,F"or as soon as possible" - will save
OL,8,F60% of households an average of #45 per
OL,9,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,11,FEarlier, the PM and chancellor spoke
OL,12,Fwith Ukraine's President Zelensky, as
OL,13,Fthe issue of defence spending looms
OL,14,Fover Healey's statement
OL,16,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,17,F"moves money and power out of
OL,18,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,19,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,20,Fgovernment borrowing
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
